P [12] (1 Favor - 4 HP hit)</p><p>f. 14 HP gladiator hit for 4 HP [10] (1 Favor - 4 HP hit)</p><p>g. Environment target hit for 4 HP [X] (2 Favor - 4 HP hit and target destroyed)</p><p>And I forgot to see it she would have picked up any new titles since more should come out as the targets went down.</p><p>I calculated that the play was worth 14 Favor; making it 24-17 in favor of the heroes with Warfang flipped to the side allowing the heroes to win.</p><p>And TLT had a Lightning Barrage in hand that would have been good for another favor when played due to HUD Goggles.</p>",
