        "created_at": "2015-01-10T12:44:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That's pretty good. &nbsp;I look forward to going through my own matches. &nbsp; With Wager Master having read most of cards your win and loss conditions could change each round. &nbsp;In fact, there is actually potential that you could win on the first villain turn based on what you heroes you have should Wager Master put out and appropriate amount of Wagelings and the condition card Losing to the Odds.&nbsp;</p>",
